rs, 1951 to 2025, across 6 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2025 that pair came in at 62% of normal on the middle of the grids, and June to July 2026 sits at 87% so far. Grid 24181 had its driest year in 1963, at 62% of normal.</p>"}
